# Rocky Travel Agency ✈️

## Project Description

Rocky Travel Agency is a simple Python program for booking holiday packages.
The user can select a destination, enter the number of tickets, and calculate
the total booking cost.

## Destinations

- Paris - $1200 per person
- Tokyo - $1500 per person
- London - $1000 per person
- Dubai - $800 per person

